# Managed Task Execution

Use this owner only when the target evidence shows dependent steps, pause/resume,
Task Anchor continuity, decision drift, or re-planning pressure shared by more
than one admitted procedure.

## Before Each Main Step

1. Re-state the current Goal, remaining Done When evidence, and relevant boundary.
2. Read only the evidence that can resolve the next step.
3. Make one risk-sized action; if evidence changes the premise, pause and update
   the Anchor/Plan before continuing.

## Recovery

After interruption, compaction, a failed or surprising check, or a new scope
signal, recover the last verified boundary and the governing user decision
before acting. A later independent request re-matches routing; it does not
silently chain workflows.

## Handoff

Return the verified result to the selected procedure. Do not claim completion
until its fitted validation and the requested terminal state are proven.
